{"id":"principal","lemma":"principal","pos":"adj","rank":840,"glosses":["main, most important","essential"],"ipa":"/pɾinθiˈpal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"principales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-principal.wav","formAudio":{"principales":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-principales.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Éste es nuestro principal objetivo.","en":"This is our main goal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461038","words":[{"g":"this one"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},null,{"g":"objective"}]},{"text":"Esta es una de las reglas principales.","en":"This is one of the basic rules.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/802020","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"rule","l":"regla"},null]},{"text":"Hay alguien en la puerta principal.","en":"Someone's at the front door.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609848","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"someone, somebody"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},null]},{"text":"Tom dejó la puerta principal abierta.","en":"Tom left the front door open.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801238","words":[null,{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},null,{"g":"the act of opening"}]},{"text":"¿Cuáles son los productos principales de este país?","en":"What are the main products of this country?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/928928","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which","l":"cuál"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"product","l":"producto"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"country"}]}]}